{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Nj39qmHrhMbAf59SQrN6RA","type":"tool_result","content":"POSE - artifact-check\n\nReconcile declared spec artifacts with immutable Git changesets\n\nUsage:\n  pose artifact-check --spec <slug> [--from <rev> --to <rev>] [--strict|--tolerant] [--json]\n\nDescription:\n  Verifies that all files declared in section 3 (Technical Plan -> Artifacts) match the actual Git change set attributed to the spec trailer (POSE-Spec: <slug>).\n\nOptions / Flags:\n  --spec <slug>            Specification slug to reconcile\n  --from <rev>             Starting git revision for change set comparison\n  --to <rev>               Ending git revision for change set comparison\n  --strict                 Fail on any undeclared or missing artifact mismatch\n  --json                   Output reconciliation results in JSON format\n\nExamples:\n  $ pose artifact-check --spec user-auth --strict","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"[private-session]","uuid":"80c02fa4-f364-4962-a17c-ba883262819e","timestamp":"2026-11-11T23:02:30.387Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"POSE - artifact-check\n\nReconcile declared spec artifacts with immutable Git changesets\n\nUsage:\n  pose artifact-check --spec <slug> [--from <rev> --to <rev>] [--strict|--tolerant] [--json]\n\nDescription:\n  Verifies that all files declared in section 3 (Technical Plan -> Artifacts) match the actual Git change set attributed to the spec trailer (POSE-Spec: <slug>).\n\nOptions / Flags:\n  --spec <slug>            Specification slug to reconcile\n  --from <rev>             Starting git revision for change set comparison\n  --to <rev>               Ending git revision for change set comparison\n  --strict                 Fail on any undeclared or missing artifact mismatch\n  --json                   Output reconciliation results in JSON format\n\nExamples:\n  $ pose artifact-check --spec user-auth --strict","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Nj39qmHrhMbAf59SQrN6RA","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"subcommandResults"}}]}
